1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,481
Have you ever stopped working

2
00:00:01,481 --> 00:00:04,237
but the unfinished task kept running through your head

3
00:00:04,237 --> 00:00:06,841
Your brain can keep incomplete work mentally active

4
00:00:06,841 --> 00:00:09,189
almost like a browser tab waiting to be closed

5
00:00:09,189 --> 00:00:14,244
That is why a half-written email or something you forgot to do can suddenly come back to mind later

6
00:00:14,244 --> 00:00:15,418
Before you stop working

7
00:00:15,418 --> 00:00:16,949
write down the exact next step

8
00:00:16,949 --> 00:00:19,451
You are giving your brain a clear place to return

9
00:00:19,451 --> 00:00:21,340
so your attention can finally move on
